=== Testing struct param member to untyped param ===
Direct: p.x= 50 p.y= 75
To typed param:
  Typed: p.x =  50
  Typed: p.y =  75
To UNtyped param:
  Untyped: p.x =  50
  Untyped: p.y =  75

With local struct:
Direct: p.x= 50 p.y= 75
To typed param:
  Typed: p.x =  50
  Typed: p.y =  75
To UNtyped param:
  Untyped: p.x =  50
  Untyped: p.y =  75

